sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Alice
    participant B as Bob
    A->>+B: one
    B->>+B: self nest
    B->>+B: deeper
    A->>B: from left to stack
    B->>A: from stack to left
    B-->>-B: unwind
    B-->>-A: two
    B-->>-A: three
    loop retry until success or the overall timeout expires
        opt backoff
            Note left of A: wait 2^n seconds before trying again
            A->>A: sleep
        end
        A->>B: try
        activate B
        B--xA: fail
        deactivate B
    end
